# Kling returns 1080p whatever you ask — its endpoint has no resolution
# parameter — so each of these clips is around 15 MB, and the two of them are
# most of this directory. They cannot be inlined in a sheet at that size, so
# nothing in the repo can use them; index.json carries every measurement taken
# from them, and `node tools/loopoff.mjs --models kling --force` makes them
# again. Committing 29 MB of video that only ever gets looked at once is not
# worth doing permanently.
*.kling.mp4
